WEBVTT

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.370
Good Morning, Kimio Kun

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.370
Komine Nozomi

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.370
No Subject

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:17.370
I'm being blackmailed by Nozomi Komine.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:22.790
The price for this is exposing ourselves to each other..

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.010
The game of exhibitionism.

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:41.020
Our Heartbeat

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:43.520
Morning.
Good morning!

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:51.730
Last practice of today is basket tossing, let's go!

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:53.280
Yay, let's go!

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:04.460
That was awesome!

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:12.460
You look happy.

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:13.380
K-Komine!

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:15.740
What do you want?

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:20.520
You look rather normal this morning.
I was wondering what's going on?

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:21.980
None of your business.

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:23.940
What is none of her business?

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.350
So-Sonada.

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:30.360
You guys get along great as always, Nozomi-chan, Kimio-kun.

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:33.720
Yeah right, no way I can't get along with her.

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:38.000
Really? Looks like you're always still both together.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:39.280
Are you guys going out?

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:41.880
N-no way! Don't even joke about that.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:43.950
I see.

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:49.920
Hey Kimio-kun, you were watching me during practice, you weren't?

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:52.440
Eh! N-nah..

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:56.380
You don't have to hide it,
I don't care when people watching me.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:01:58.510
But

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:04.200
even if they're not panties, I guess,
I'm little embarrassed to be seen by a boy.

00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:05.880
Hey!

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:06.520
Yo! Michiru.

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:10.650
You like her.

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:12.480
No! No! No! No!

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:19.440
I mean, she's very pretty and very popular in the class, but...

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:21.700
Well I... uh...

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:22.980
Forget it.

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:25.160
That's why you like her?

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:31.500
I think, I'm becoming interested in this,

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:33.080
Sonada, Michiru-san.

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:36.660
I feel something bad arising.

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:42.420
Hmm, what should I eat for lunch?

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:44.900
Kimio, we're doing it today.

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:46.680
The prettiest girl in class election.

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:47.640
What?

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:51.560
All the guys should have to participate.
Don't forget to put your name.

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:52.900
Class Queen Contest Final Round

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.920
These guys are thinking something stupid again.

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:58.260
I bet everyone's going to put Michiru.

00:02:58.260 --> 00:02:59.490
No way.

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:04.830
But, I am a bit curious to see who votes for.

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:06.980
Everyone's going to vote for you.

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:07.820
That's not true.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:10.740
Doing pointless things like this is not in my favor.

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:17.940
It seems Makino has changed a lot, and become popular.

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:22.050
There's also people that follow Watanuki.

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:25.760
I think the person who won't get any votes is...

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:32.400
Most Popular Queen

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:35.270
Sonoda.

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:36.280
Sonoda.

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:37.480
Tanaka.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:38.880
Sonoda.

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:40.190
Sonoda.

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:41.520
Makino.

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:43.040
Watanuki.

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:44.260
Komine.

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:45.620
Komine.

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:47.120
Sonoda.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:48.380
Komine.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:49.720
Komine.

00:03:50.260 --> 00:03:51.120
Komine.

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:52.120
Tanaka.

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:53.330
Komine.

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:56.600
We have the results!

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:00.280
The queen of the classroom is...

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:02.900
<i>Komine Nozomi-san</i>!

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:05.510
Are you serious?!

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.680
Ahh.. Michiru lost.

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:11.500
I was so sure you were going to win.

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:18.320
Congrats Komine-san, incredible. You did it!

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:21.940
Sorry but, I'm not interested at all.

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:27.120
Oh, I see.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:28.450
Let's go! girls.

00:04:29.180 --> 00:04:32.300
We have a Physics this afternoon, so we need to eat up.

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:34.500
Ok, if you say so.

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:38.180
That was unbelievable, I would've never have thought Sonoda would lose.

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:40.720
Well, I actually vote Komine.

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:42.520
Really? Me too.

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:44.430
Sometimes she has a really cute smile.

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:46.920
So you've noticed it too.

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:51.160
Murakami, you should trash those votes so the girls don't see them.

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:53.140
Yeah, that's classified information.

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:54.780
I know that.

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:59.220
Alright, let's go eat.
We should go to a convenience store.

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:09.920
I'm done organizing.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:14.080
Thanks, you can go change and go home now.

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:26.430
Class Queen Contest Final Round

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:26.430
Komine Nozomi

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:26.430
Suga, Kimio

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:34.480
What's this? What happened?

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:35.880
Sonoda-san.

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:38.920
Did they hurt you?

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:41.440
Sometimes they do terrible things.

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:49.990
But it can't be helped, you're irritable Nozomi-chan.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:55.600
You said you didn't care about it, but in reality you're happy right?

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:59.920
You were so quiet, how did you do it?

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:02.250
You wanted to show that you're more popular than me?

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:09.220
How sad, the atmosphere should have kept itself as it should have, like normal.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:11.700
Let's see what this is.

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:15.180
Kimio-kun voted for you.

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:18.460
Maybe he really like you?

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:24.020
And if you kept this, it means you like him too.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:33.460
It's settled.
I am going to make sure Kimio Suga, never ever looks at you again.

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:36.040
I've just use a little effort.

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:37.460
If I do that,

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:40.560
I am sure, I'll feel good.

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:55.810
Kimio-kun.

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:56.700
Kimio-

00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:57.880
I heard from Sonoda.

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:00.480
Sounds like you did something bad to her.

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:06.320
You told her it was a shame that she didn't win and how she's no ,

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:09.940
longer the center of attention in the class.

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:11.820
She even congratulated you.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:14.400
I'm disappointed in you,

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:16.160
you said you didn't care about the results

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:18.000
but apparently that's not the case at all

00:07:17.840 --> 00:07:19.910
You like Sonoda-san.

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:22.420
I'm not talking about that,

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:24.590
why are you acting like that?

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:43.000
Yeah, I saw Komine a little bit ago, I told her all I had to say.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.600
Ah, you didn't have to do that.

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:48.280
I don't think Nozomi-chan did it with any bad intentions.

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:49.690
Of course it was with bad intentions.

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:55.160
I noticed she was jealous of your popularity in the class. She puts up the "I don't care" face.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:56.860
You think?

00:07:57.460 --> 00:08:00.680
I just want to be good with everyone.

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:04.880
Anyways, if anything comes up again tell me.  I'll back you up.

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:07.760
Thanks, Kimio-Kun.

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:13.380
But if you keep acting so nice to me, I'll start to believe it, you know?

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:24.270
I told you, don't get involved.

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:26.110
Even if you know the truth?

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:32.680
It frustrates me that nobody knows the real you,
like when you are with me.

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:35.580
What's going on, Komine?

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:47.400
Morning!

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:48.840
Good morning, Kimio-Kun.

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:50.550
Hey, Sonoda.

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:52.300
Thanks for yesterday.

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:54.360
If you want, you can come watch my practice.

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:59.280
I think, I can do much better if you watch me.

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:00.980
Y-yea...um..

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:04.660
Yo Michirin, quit fooling around during practice!

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:06.440
You two lovers~

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:07.980
Ehh? That's not true.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:10.800
I'm only that way with you, kay?

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:16.610
Sorry girls, let's resume practice.

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:21.490
See you in class, Kimio-kun.

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:34.480
It has to be sauce.

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:36.680
Nope, it has to be mayonnaise.

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.340
Don't you guys understand the perfection that is ketchup?

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:41.180
Hey Kimio-kun, do you know this place?

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:43.890
It's an amusement park that just opened.

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:46.600
We should go together.

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:48.300
Eh? Why with me?

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:50.200
Come on, am I no good?

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:53.420
Kimio... since when..?

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:55.380
are you such close friends with miss #1.

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:56.360
It's nothing..

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:02.360
I'm not #1 anymore, after what happened yesterday.

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:05.040
Komine Nozomi-chan is #1.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:10.670
That's why I left the spot of the class idol to Nozomi-chan.

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:15.010
I want to be Kimio-kun's.

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:16.380
What?!?!

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:26.140
Are you ok, Sonada?

00:10:26.780 --> 00:10:28.060
Are you okay, Michiru?

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:31.230
Hey Komine-san, don't you think that was rude? You just made her trip.

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:32.860
Apologize!

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:34.980
Are you pissed about what Michiru said about you?

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:39.700
Why? I haven't done anything wrong.

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:43.910
-So wild.
-Tough.

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:46.100
Komine-san is so cruel.

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:47.320
Incredible...

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:51.060
It's fine, I guess the way I said it was a bit crude.

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:53.500
Don't blame her. 'kay?

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:56.140
Sonada is such a good person.

00:10:56.140 --> 00:11:00.120
Compared to Komine, who'd would've thought she had such a bad personality.

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:01.340
Man, I should've voted for Sonada.

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:04.600
Are you stupid, Komine?

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:10.460
What was that all about?

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:12.940
How long are you going to keep this up?

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:17.960
Is this what you meant by "becoming interested in her"?

00:11:17.960 --> 00:11:18.900
Starting to mistreat her?

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:25.040
What are you thinking? Things in class were finally getting better
and now you go and ruin it.

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:25.870
Not interested.

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:28.160
I am not going to change.

00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:32.560
The only thing that makes my heartbeat race is showing you how I am.

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:33.940
Then why?

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:39.920
I know you're neglecting me now because of what's going on but...

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:41.480
want to listen to the story?

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:46.360
Will what I am about to say get through to you?

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:49.810
And not just what the other people are saying to you... but mine.

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:57.100
She's not good.

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:00.880
Sonoda Michiru, is not a good person.

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:02.950
She's not good for you.

00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:07.220
Now you're going to talk shit about her?

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:10.100
Cut the crap! I didn't think you were like this.

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:12.120
We're no longer friends.

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:31.980
Sheesh, I give up.

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:37.720
To the clubhouse?

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:39.920
That girl...

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:44.570
What are you doing?

00:12:45.380 --> 00:12:46.260
Kimio-kun.

00:12:48.020 --> 00:12:49.140
I thought you wouldn't talk to me anymore.

00:12:49.900 --> 00:12:51.740
It's because you're here.

00:12:52.980 --> 00:12:54.710
You don't plan to do anything to Sonoda, do you?

00:12:57.460 --> 00:12:59.280
She called me here.

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:01.800
I'm here because of her.

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:03.760
She called you?

00:13:04.640 --> 00:13:05.160
For what?

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:07.890
Probably to declare victory.

00:13:08.360 --> 00:13:12.850
And slowly but surely she will keep taking important things away from me.

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:15.980
Over here.

00:13:21.140 --> 00:13:23.400
Nozomi-chan, are you here?

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:26.540
The door was open so, I'm sure she go here.

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:28.160
Strange, oh well.

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:33.300
Why you should have to hide too?

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:34.830
It was an impulse.

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:40.740
Oh shit!

00:13:42.600 --> 00:13:45.120
Who's there? Is someone in the lockers?

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:46.800
Come out right now!

00:13:48.940 --> 00:13:50.540
It's me, Sonoda-san.

00:13:54.420 --> 00:13:56.580
So you were here, Nozomi-chan.

00:13:57.340 --> 00:13:59.880
Quit showing up like you're from a horror movie.

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:04.530
Are you plotting to hide something in there?

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:11.030
Let me warn you. I am recording you. I'll recommend
you don't act like your usual self.

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:19.380
My usual self? You're so mean Nozomi-chan.
Do you hate me that much?

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:22.100
Komine is at it again...

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:25.710
But.. why did Sonoda call Komine here?

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:27.170
Just kidding.

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:31.480
You think you're going to scare me with that?

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:37.060
It's obvious that even if you were recording it,
people will trust me more than you.

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:37.880
Sonoda...

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:44.200
It won't help you at all, except you ruin your plan more.

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:46.040
Wouldn't it be bad if someone came and saw you like this?

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:48.960
Nobody will come until the practice is over.

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:50.860
That is why I called you here.

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:57.700
Even if someone came, they'd probably think
you were trying to do something to my locker.

00:14:58.700 --> 00:15:04.960
Like when I drenched your blouse yesterday.

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:15.970
You were so wet from head to toe, good thing you didn't get sick.

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:20.940
But you're strong, in heart and body.

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:28.660
Your popularity sunk to the abyss, you have to enjoy it a little bit at least.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:32.360
Now nobody in the class even looks at you.

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:34.660
I don't need that...

00:15:35.840 --> 00:15:43.460
To protect my pride,
I don't want people to look at or flirt with someone I am not.

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:46.300
Ehh, so what will you do?

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:55.140
I only care about one person, and for that person
to see me for who I really am, even if a little bit.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:02.640
I only need that.

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:10.020
Is that Kimio-kun?

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:15.180
But I think it's impossible at this point.

00:16:15.880 --> 00:16:19.380
He will believe anything I say to him.

00:16:19.980 --> 00:16:23.880
When I put my arms around him he gets nervous.
When I ask him for a date he is speechless.

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:27.630
Also in the class he's always focusing in me.

00:16:29.460 --> 00:16:35.760
Poor Nozomi-chan.
You think if he saw this, he'd be on my side?

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:36.560
Not likely.

00:16:40.260 --> 00:16:42.860
You heard all of that...?

00:16:44.340 --> 00:16:46.900
You lied to me.

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:50.100
You guys planned this out, didn't you?

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:53.280
You were going to humiliate me to become popular.

00:16:55.400 --> 00:17:00.120
How unfortunate, if there's no proof, then nobody will believe you-

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:04.410
You weren't... recording?

00:17:05.280 --> 00:17:10.380
Komine, didn't have such intentions from the start,
because I was listening to the whole thing from the locker.

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:14.440
You didn't want to show who you really are.

00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:26.730
I forgot that, There has a person that is always looking at me.

00:17:27.720 --> 00:17:32.940
Sometimes it may get annoying, but deep down she really wants to know me.

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:38.570
That's why I had to believe what she said, I should've listened.

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:43.290
I lost sight of her even being so close.

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:45.500
Kimio-kun...

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:53.550
We are fine with having just one person that understands us for real.

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:04.640
I'm sorry, seriously.

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:13.160
I already forgave you, though it all happened because you voted for me.

00:18:13.680 --> 00:18:16.740
If you would've voted for Sonoda-san, none of this would've happened.

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:22.300
That's because I thought you wouldn't get a single vote...

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:24.880
Why do you even know that anyway?

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:30.830
It's a secret.
You are the type of person who cannot hide something.

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:34.380
Shut up. Let's go home.

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:45.040
Oi Komine, can you cut out this act?

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:47.770
It's not, listen Kimio-kun...

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:55.180
Since you said those things before,
my heart is pounding harder than ever. It just won't stop.

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:57.820
I wonder why?

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:01.920
Wh-who knows...

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:06.840
Quit holding me already.

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:09.060
No way, just a little longer.

00:19:09.600 --> 00:19:11.020
You know...

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:20.640
Ever since, Sonada hasn't changed a bit.

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:22.820
She is still the most popular chick in the class.

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:28.440
What she did was wrong, but I also stopped believing that crap so easily.

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:31.980
What's more is that Komine can even forgave her.

00:19:33.160 --> 00:19:37.660
I bet Sonada was just scared of losing her place.

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:45.200
It's not that she hates Komine. She was just afraid
of how fast people's feelings can change so easily.

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:47.660
And over here...

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:04.760
Oh boy. Same as usual, huh?

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:07.380
Yeah, yeah. I'm opening up now.

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:20.200
Yaho~ Kimio-kun.

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:24.200
What the hell are you thinking? Being completely naked is just...

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:32.000
Well you've seen Makino-san's, Watanuki-san's, and even Sonada-san's boobs already.

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:35.300
I always thought it was so unfair!

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:36.670
I don't understand you!

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:41.160
Did I excite you?

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:48.160
You might say... anyways, put something on or you'll catch a cold!

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:56.520
Kimio-kun, let's keep playing our game, kay?

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:59.500
Classs Queen Contest Final Round

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:59.500
